  (text "Kurogane K-7 mainboard rev A: CM5 carrier, 6 layers (L1 sig / L2 GND / L3 sig+pwr / L4 pwr / L5 GND / L6 sig).\nBoard 190 x 105 mm sits behind the 7 in display. Placement zones are on Dwgs.User in the PCB.\nEach sheet below lists what goes in it. Copy proven blocks from the CM5 IO Board reference design.\nNet map: docs/cm5_signal_map.csv. Power design: build plan doc, 'Power system'." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.00 25.00 0)
